[{"id":"calculus:ch-foundations:Formula:0","ch":"ch-foundations","chEn":"Foundations & Precalculus Review","chAr":"الأسس الرياضية ومراجعة ما قبل التفاضل والتكامل","tag":"Formula","f":"Power","f_ar":"Power (الأسس الرياضية ومراجعة ما قبل التفاضل والتكامل)","b":"\\( x^{n},\\ x^{p/q} \\)","b_ar":"\\( x^{n},\\ x^{p/q} \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-foundations:Formula:1","ch":"ch-foundations","chEn":"Foundations & Precalculus Review","chAr":"الأسس الرياضية ومراجعة ما قبل التفاضل والتكامل","tag":"Formula","f":"Exponential","f_ar":"Exponential (الأسس الرياضية ومراجعة ما قبل التفاضل والتكامل)","b":"\\( a^{x},\\ e^{x} \\)","b_ar":"\\( a^{x},\\ e^{x} \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-foundations:Formula:2","ch":"ch-foundations","chEn":"Foundations & Precalculus Review","chAr":"الأسس الرياضية ومراجعة ما قبل التفاضل والتكامل","tag":"Formula","f":"Logarithm","f_ar":"Logarithm (الأسس الرياضية ومراجعة ما قبل التفاضل والتكامل)","b":"\\( \\log_a x,\\ \\ln x \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\log_a x,\\ \\ln x \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-foundations:Formula:3","ch":"ch-foundations","chEn":"Foundations & Precalculus Review","chAr":"الأسس الرياضية ومراجعة ما قبل التفاضل والتكامل","tag":"Formula","f":"Trigonometric","f_ar":"Trigonometric (الأسس الرياضية ومراجعة ما قبل التفاضل والتكامل)","b":"\\( \\sin x,\\ \\cos x,\\ \\tan x \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\sin x,\\ \\cos x,\\ \\tan x \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-limits:Definition:4","ch":"ch-limits","chEn":"Limits & Continuity","chAr":"النهايات والاتصال","tag":"Definition","f":"Definition 1.1 — Informal Limit & One-Sided Limits","f_ar":"تعريف 1.1 — Informal النهاية & One-Sided النهايات","b":"<p>We write \\( \\displaystyle \\lim_{x \\to c} f(x) = L \\) if the outputs \\( f(x) \\) can be made arbitrarily close to \\( L \\) by taking \\( x \\) sufficiently close to \\( c \\) (with \\( x \\neq c \\)).</p><ul><li><strong>Left-Hand Limit:</strong> \\( \\displaystyle \\lim_{x \\to c^-} f(x) = L_1 \\) considers only inputs \\( x < c \\).</li><li><strong>Right-Hand Limit:</strong> \\( \\displaystyle \\lim_{x \\to c^+} f(x) = L_2 \\) considers only inputs \\( x > c \\).</li></ul>","b_ar":"<p>We write \\( \\displaystyle \\lim_{x \\to c} f(x) = L \\) if the outputs \\( f(x) \\) can be made arbitrarily close to \\( L \\) by taking \\( x \\) sufficiently close to \\( c \\) (with \\( x \\neq c \\)).</p><ul><li><strong>Left-Hand Limit:</strong> \\( \\displaystyle \\lim_{x \\to c^-} f(x) = L_1 \\) considers only inputs \\( x < c \\).</li><li><strong>Right-Hand Limit:</strong> \\( \\displaystyle \\lim_{x \\to c^+} f(x) = L_2 \\) considers only inputs \\( x > c \\).</li></ul>"},{"id":"calculus:ch-limits:Formula:5","ch":"ch-limits","chEn":"Limits & Continuity","chAr":"النهايات والاتصال","tag":"Formula","f":"Trig squeeze","f_ar":"Trig squeeze (النهايات والاتصال)","b":"\\( \\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to 0}\\frac{\\sin x}{x}=1 \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to 0}\\frac{\\sin x}{x}=1 \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-limits:Formula:6","ch":"ch-limits","chEn":"Limits & Continuity","chAr":"النهايات والاتصال","tag":"Formula","f":"The number e","f_ar":"The number e (النهايات والاتصال)","b":"\\( \\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\!\\Big(1+\\tfrac1x\\Big)^{x}=e \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\!\\Big(1+\\tfrac1x\\Big)^{x}=e \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-derivatives:Formula:7","ch":"ch-derivatives","chEn":"Derivatives","chAr":"المشتقات وقواعد الاشتقاق","tag":"Formula","f":"Power","f_ar":"Power (المشتقات وقواعد الاشتقاق)","b":"\\( \\frac{d}{dx}x^{n}=n x^{n-1} \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\frac{d}{dx}x^{n}=n x^{n-1} \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-derivatives:Formula:8","ch":"ch-derivatives","chEn":"Derivatives","chAr":"المشتقات وقواعد الاشتقاق","tag":"Formula","f":"Product","f_ar":"Product (المشتقات وقواعد الاشتقاق)","b":"\\( (fg)'=f'g+fg' \\)","b_ar":"\\( (fg)'=f'g+fg' \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-derivatives:Formula:9","ch":"ch-derivatives","chEn":"Derivatives","chAr":"المشتقات وقواعد الاشتقاق","tag":"Formula","f":"Quotient","f_ar":"Quotient (المشتقات وقواعد الاشتقاق)","b":"\\( (\\tfrac{f}{g})'=\\frac{f'g-fg'}{g^2} \\)","b_ar":"\\( (\\tfrac{f}{g})'=\\frac{f'g-fg'}{g^2} \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-derivatives:Formula:10","ch":"ch-derivatives","chEn":"Derivatives","chAr":"المشتقات وقواعد الاشتقاق","tag":"Formula","f":"Chain","f_ar":"Chain (المشتقات وقواعد الاشتقاق)","b":"\\( \\frac{d}{dx}f(g(x))=f'(g(x))\\,g'(x) \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\frac{d}{dx}f(g(x))=f'(g(x))\\,g'(x) \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-integrals:Theorem:11","ch":"ch-integrals","chEn":"Integrals","chAr":"التكاملات غير المحدودة والمحدودة","tag":"Theorem","f":"Theorem & Uniform Sum Formula · Integrability of Continuous Functions","f_ar":"Theorem & Uniform Sum Formula · Integrability of Continuous Functions","b":"<p><strong>Theorem:</strong> Every continuous function on a closed bounded interval \\( [a, b] \\) is Riemann integrable. Furthermore, using a regular partition into \\( n \\) subintervals of uniform width \\( \\Delta x = \\frac{b-a}{n} \\) with right-endpoint evaluation \\( x_i = a + i\\Delta x \\): \\[ \\int_a^b f(x)\\,dx = \\lim_{n\\to\\infty} \\sum_{i=1}^n f\\left(a + i\\frac{b-a}{n}\\right)\\frac{b-a}{n}. \\quad \\blacksquare \\]</p>","b_ar":"<p><strong>Theorem:</strong> Every continuous function on a closed bounded interval \\( [a, b] \\) is Riemann integrable. Furthermore, using a regular partition into \\( n \\) subintervals of uniform width \\( \\Delta x = \\frac{b-a}{n} \\) with right-endpoint evaluation \\( x_i = a + i\\Delta x \\): \\[ \\int_a^b f(x)\\,dx = \\lim_{n\\to\\infty} \\sum_{i=1}^n f\\left(a + i\\frac{b-a}{n}\\right)\\frac{b-a}{n}. \\quad \\blacksquare \\]</p>"},{"id":"calculus:ch-integrals:Formula:12","ch":"ch-integrals","chEn":"Integrals","chAr":"التكاملات غير المحدودة والمحدودة","tag":"Formula","f":"Linearity","f_ar":"Linearity (التكاملات غير المحدودة والمحدودة)","b":"\\( \\int (\\alpha f+\\beta g)=\\alpha\\int f+\\beta\\int g \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\int (\\alpha f+\\beta g)=\\alpha\\int f+\\beta\\int g \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-integrals:Formula:13","ch":"ch-integrals","chEn":"Integrals","chAr":"التكاملات غير المحدودة والمحدودة","tag":"Formula","f":"Additivity","f_ar":"Additivity (التكاملات غير المحدودة والمحدودة)","b":"\\( \\int_a^b f+\\int_b^c f=\\int_a^c f \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\int_a^b f+\\int_b^c f=\\int_a^c f \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-integrals:Formula:14","ch":"ch-integrals","chEn":"Integrals","chAr":"التكاملات غير المحدودة والمحدودة","tag":"Formula","f":"Bounds","f_ar":"Bounds (التكاملات غير المحدودة والمحدودة)","b":"\\( m(b-a)\\le\\int_a^b f\\le M(b-a) \\)","b_ar":"\\( m(b-a)\\le\\int_a^b f\\le M(b-a) \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-integrals:Formula:15","ch":"ch-integrals","chEn":"Integrals","chAr":"التكاملات غير المحدودة والمحدودة","tag":"Formula","f":"Reversal","f_ar":"Reversal (التكاملات غير المحدودة والمحدودة)","b":"\\( \\int_b^a f=-\\int_a^b f \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\int_b^a f=-\\int_a^b f \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-ftc:Definition:16","ch":"ch-ftc","chEn":"The Fundamental Theorem","chAr":"النظرية الأساسية للتفاضل والتكامل","tag":"Definition","f":"Definition 4.1 — Area Accumulation Function","f_ar":"تعريف 4.1 — المساحة Accumulation الدالة","b":"<p>Let \\( f \\) be continuous on \\( [a, b] \\). For any \\( x \\in [a, b] \\), the <strong>accumulation function</strong> \\( A(x) \\) measures the net signed area under \\( f \\) from the fixed lower limit \\( a \\) up to the dynamic upper limit \\( x \\): \\[ A(x) = \\int_a^x f(t)\\,dt. \\]</p>","b_ar":"<p>Let \\( f \\) be continuous on \\( [a, b] \\). For any \\( x \\in [a, b] \\), the <strong>accumulation function</strong> \\( A(x) \\) measures the net signed area under \\( f \\) from the fixed lower limit \\( a \\) up to the dynamic upper limit \\( x \\): \\[ A(x) = \\int_a^x f(t)\\,dt. \\]</p>"},{"id":"calculus:ch-ftc:Formula:17","ch":"ch-ftc","chEn":"The Fundamental Theorem","chAr":"النظرية الأساسية للتفاضل والتكامل","tag":"Formula","f":"FTC Part I","f_ar":"FTC Part I (النظرية الأساسية للتفاضل والتكامل)","b":"\\( \\dfrac{d}{dx}\\int_a^x f(t)\\,dt = f(x) \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\dfrac{d}{dx}\\int_a^x f(t)\\,dt = f(x) \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-ftc:Formula:18","ch":"ch-ftc","chEn":"The Fundamental Theorem","chAr":"النظرية الأساسية للتفاضل والتكامل","tag":"Formula","f":"FTC Part II","f_ar":"FTC Part II (النظرية الأساسية للتفاضل والتكامل)","b":"\\( \\int_a^b f(x)\\,dx = F(b)-F(a) \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\int_a^b f(x)\\,dx = F(b)-F(a) \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-ftc:Formula:19","ch":"ch-ftc","chEn":"The Fundamental Theorem","chAr":"النظرية الأساسية للتفاضل والتكامل","tag":"Formula","f":"Net change","f_ar":"Net change (النظرية الأساسية للتفاضل والتكامل)","b":"\\( \\int_a^b F'(x)\\,dx = F(b)-F(a) \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\int_a^b F'(x)\\,dx = F(b)-F(a) \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-ftc:Formula:20","ch":"ch-ftc","chEn":"The Fundamental Theorem","chAr":"النظرية الأساسية للتفاضل والتكامل","tag":"Formula","f":"Chain rule form","f_ar":"Chain rule form","b":"\\( \\dfrac{d}{dx}\\int_a^{g(x)}\\!f(t)\\,dt = f(g(x))\\,g'(x) \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\dfrac{d}{dx}\\int_a^{g(x)}\\!f(t)\\,dt = f(g(x))\\,g'(x) \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-applications:Formula:21","ch":"ch-applications","chEn":"Applications of Derivatives","chAr":"تطبيقات الاشتقاق والتحسين والمعدلات المرتبطة","tag":"Formula","f":"Critical point","f_ar":"Critical point (تطبيقات الاشتقاق والتحسين والمعدلات المرتبطة)","b":"\\( f'(c)=0 \\) or \\( f'(c) \\) undefined","b_ar":"\\(f'(c)=0\\) or \\(f'(c)\\) undefined (تطبيقات الاشتقاق والتحسين والمعدلات المرتبطة)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-applications:Formula:22","ch":"ch-applications","chEn":"Applications of Derivatives","chAr":"تطبيقات الاشتقاق والتحسين والمعدلات المرتبطة","tag":"Formula","f":"1st deriv. test","f_ar":"1st deriv. test (تطبيقات الاشتقاق والتحسين والمعدلات المرتبطة)","b":"\\( f' \\) changes \\( +\\to- \\): local max; \\( -\\to+ \\): local min","b_ar":"\\( f' \\) changes \\( +\\to- \\): local max; \\( -\\to+ \\): local min"},{"id":"calculus:ch-applications:Formula:23","ch":"ch-applications","chEn":"Applications of Derivatives","chAr":"تطبيقات الاشتقاق والتحسين والمعدلات المرتبطة","tag":"Formula","f":"2nd deriv. test","f_ar":"2nd deriv. test (تطبيقات الاشتقاق والتحسين والمعدلات المرتبطة)","b":"f''(c)&gt;0 : min;  f''(c)&lt;0 : max","b_ar":"f''(c)&gt;0 : min;  f''(c)&lt;0 : max (تطبيقات الاشتقاق والتحسين والمعدلات المرتبطة)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-applications:Formula:24","ch":"ch-applications","chEn":"Applications of Derivatives","chAr":"تطبيقات الاشتقاق والتحسين والمعدلات المرتبطة","tag":"Formula","f":"L'Hôpital","f_ar":"L'Hôpital (تطبيقات الاشتقاق والتحسين والمعدلات المرتبطة)","b":"\\( \\lim\\dfrac{f}{g}\\!=\\!\\lim\\dfrac{f'}{g'} \\) when \\( \\tfrac{0}{0} \\) or \\( \\tfrac{\\infty}{\\infty} \\)","b_ar":"\\(\\lim\\dfrac{f}{g}\\!=\\!\\lim\\dfrac{f'}{g'}\\) عندما \\(\\tfrac{0}{0}\\) or \\(\\tfrac{\\infty}{\\infty}\\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-techniques:Formula:25","ch":"ch-techniques","chEn":"Techniques of Integration","chAr":"طرق وتقنيات التكامل المتقدمة","tag":"Formula","f":"Substitution","f_ar":"Substitution (طرق وتقنيات التكامل المتقدمة)","b":"\\( \\int f(g(x))g'(x)\\,dx = \\int f(u)\\,du \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\int f(g(x))g'(x)\\,dx = \\int f(u)\\,du \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-techniques:Formula:26","ch":"ch-techniques","chEn":"Techniques of Integration","chAr":"طرق وتقنيات التكامل المتقدمة","tag":"Formula","f":"By Parts","f_ar":"By Parts (طرق وتقنيات التكامل المتقدمة)","b":"\\( \\int u\\,dv = uv - \\int v\\,du \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\int u\\,dv = uv - \\int v\\,du \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-techniques:Formula:27","ch":"ch-techniques","chEn":"Techniques of Integration","chAr":"طرق وتقنيات التكامل المتقدمة","tag":"Formula","f":"Trig Sub","f_ar":"Trig Sub (طرق وتقنيات التكامل المتقدمة)","b":"\\( \\sqrt{a^2-u^2} \\to u=a\\sin\\theta \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\sqrt{a^2-u^2} \\to u=a\\sin\\theta \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-techniques:Formula:28","ch":"ch-techniques","chEn":"Techniques of Integration","chAr":"طرق وتقنيات التكامل المتقدمة","tag":"Formula","f":"Partial Fractions","f_ar":"Partial Fractions (طرق وتقنيات التكامل المتقدمة)","b":"\\( \\frac{1}{(x-a)(x-b)} = \\frac{A}{x-a} + \\frac{B}{x-b} \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\frac{1}{(x-a)(x-b)} = \\frac{A}{x-a} + \\frac{B}{x-b} \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-appint:Theorem:29","ch":"ch-appint","chEn":"Applications of Integration","chAr":"تطبيقات التكامل: المساحات والحجوم وطول القوس","tag":"Theorem","f":"Theorem 7.2 — Average Value of a Continuous Function","f_ar":"نظرية 7.2 — المتوسط قيمة من a متصلة الدالة","b":"<p>Let \\(f:[a,b] \\to \\mathbb{R}\\) be continuous. The average (mean) value \\(f_{\\text{avg}}\\) of \\(f\\) on \\([a,b]\\) is:</p>\\[ f_{\\text{avg}} = \\frac{1}{b - a}\\int_a^b f(x)\\,dx \\]<p>By the Mean Value Theorem for Definite Integrals, there exists at least one point \\(c \\in (a, b)\\) such that \\(f(c) = f_{\\text{avg}}\\), geometrically guaranteeing a rectangle with base \\((b-a)\\) and height \\(f(c)\\) whose area equals the exact integral.</p>","b_ar":"<p>Let \\(f:[a,b] \\to \\mathbb{R}\\) be continuous. The average (mean) value \\(f_{\\text{avg}}\\) of \\(f\\) on \\([a,b]\\) is:</p>\\[ f_{\\text{avg}} = \\frac{1}{b - a}\\int_a^b f(x)\\,dx \\]<p>By the Mean Value Theorem for Definite Integrals, there exists at least one point \\(c \\in (a, b)\\) such that \\(f(c) = f_{\\text{avg}}\\), geometrically guaranteeing a rectangle with base \\((b-a)\\) and height \\(f(c)\\) whose area equals the exact integral.</p>"},{"id":"calculus:ch-appint:Formula:30","ch":"ch-appint","chEn":"Applications of Integration","chAr":"تطبيقات التكامل: المساحات والحجوم وطول القوس","tag":"Formula","f":"Area Between Curves","f_ar":"المساحة Between Curves","b":"\\( \\int_a^b [y_{\\text{top}} - y_{\\text{bot}}]\\,dx \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\int_a^b [y_{\\text{top}} - y_{\\text{bot}}]\\,dx \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-appint:Formula:31","ch":"ch-appint","chEn":"Applications of Integration","chAr":"تطبيقات التكامل: المساحات والحجوم وطول القوس","tag":"Formula","f":"Washer Method","f_ar":"Washer Method (تطبيقات التكامل: المساحات والحجوم وطول القوس)","b":"\\( \\pi\\int [R(x)^2 - r(x)^2]\\,dx \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\pi\\int [R(x)^2 - r(x)^2]\\,dx \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-appint:Formula:32","ch":"ch-appint","chEn":"Applications of Integration","chAr":"تطبيقات التكامل: المساحات والحجوم وطول القوس","tag":"Formula","f":"Cylindrical Shells","f_ar":"Cylindrical Shells (تطبيقات التكامل: المساحات والحجوم وطول القوس)","b":"\\( 2\\pi\\int (\\text{radius})(\\text{height})\\,dx \\)","b_ar":"\\( 2\\pi\\int (\\text{radius})(\\text{height})\\,dx \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-appint:Formula:33","ch":"ch-appint","chEn":"Applications of Integration","chAr":"تطبيقات التكامل: المساحات والحجوم وطول القوس","tag":"Formula","f":"Arc Length","f_ar":"Arc Length (تطبيقات التكامل: المساحات والحجوم وطول القوس)","b":"\\( \\int \\sqrt{1 + [f'(x)]^2}\\,dx \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\int \\sqrt{1 + [f'(x)]^2}\\,dx \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-diffeq:Formula:34","ch":"ch-diffeq","chEn":"Differential Equations","chAr":"المعادلات التفاضلية والنمذجة الرياضية","tag":"Formula","f":"Separable ODE","f_ar":"Separable ODE (المعادلات التفاضلية والنمذجة الرياضية)","b":"\\( \\frac{dy}{dx}=g(x)h(y) \\implies \\int\\frac{dy}{h(y)}=\\int g(x)\\,dx \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\frac{dy}{dx}=g(x)h(y) \\implies \\int\\frac{dy}{h(y)}=\\int g(x)\\,dx \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-diffeq:Formula:35","ch":"ch-diffeq","chEn":"Differential Equations","chAr":"المعادلات التفاضلية والنمذجة الرياضية","tag":"Formula","f":"Exponential Growth","f_ar":"Exponential Growth (المعادلات التفاضلية والنمذجة الرياضية)","b":"\\( y'=ky \\implies y=y_0 e^{kt} \\)","b_ar":"\\( y'=ky \\implies y=y_0 e^{kt} \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-diffeq:Formula:36","ch":"ch-diffeq","chEn":"Differential Equations","chAr":"المعادلات التفاضلية والنمذجة الرياضية","tag":"Formula","f":"Integrating Factor","f_ar":"Integrating Factor (المعادلات التفاضلية والنمذجة الرياضية)","b":"\\( y'+P(x)y=Q(x),\\ \\mu=e^{\\int P\\,dx} \\)","b_ar":"\\( y'+P(x)y=Q(x),\\ \\mu=e^{\\int P\\,dx} \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-diffeq:Formula:37","ch":"ch-diffeq","chEn":"Differential Equations","chAr":"المعادلات التفاضلية والنمذجة الرياضية","tag":"Formula","f":"Logistic Growth","f_ar":"Logistic Growth (المعادلات التفاضلية والنمذجة الرياضية)","b":"\\( \\frac{dP}{dt}=kP\\left(1-\\frac{P}{M}\\right) \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\frac{dP}{dt}=kP\\left(1-\\frac{P}{M}\\right) \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-parametric:Formula:38","ch":"ch-parametric","chEn":"Parametric & Polar","chAr":"المعادلات البارامترية والإحداثيات القطبية","tag":"Formula","f":"Parametric Slope","f_ar":"Parametric الميل","b":"\\( \\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{dy/dt}{dx/dt} \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{dy/dt}{dx/dt} \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-parametric:Formula:39","ch":"ch-parametric","chEn":"Parametric & Polar","chAr":"المعادلات البارامترية والإحداثيات القطبية","tag":"Formula","f":"Parametric Arc Length","f_ar":"Parametric Arc Length (المعادلات البارامترية والإحداثيات القطبية)","b":"\\( L=\\int_a^b\\sqrt{(x')^2+(y')^2}\\,dt \\)","b_ar":"\\( L=\\int_a^b\\sqrt{(x')^2+(y')^2}\\,dt \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-parametric:Formula:40","ch":"ch-parametric","chEn":"Parametric & Polar","chAr":"المعادلات البارامترية والإحداثيات القطبية","tag":"Formula","f":"Polar Area","f_ar":"Polar المساحة","b":"\\( A=\\frac{1}{2}\\int_\\alpha^\\beta r^2\\,d\\theta \\)","b_ar":"\\( A=\\frac{1}{2}\\int_\\alpha^\\beta r^2\\,d\\theta \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-parametric:Formula:41","ch":"ch-parametric","chEn":"Parametric & Polar","chAr":"المعادلات البارامترية والإحداثيات القطبية","tag":"Formula","f":"Polar Coordinates","f_ar":"Polar الإحداثيات","b":"\\( x=r\\cos\\theta,\\; y=r\\sin\\theta \\)","b_ar":"\\( x=r\\cos\\theta,\\; y=r\\sin\\theta \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-series:Formula:42","ch":"ch-series","chEn":"Sequences & Series","chAr":"المتتابعات والمتسلسلات اللانهائية","tag":"Formula","f":"Exponential","f_ar":"Exponential (المتتابعات والمتسلسلات اللانهائية)","b":"\\( e^x = \\sum_{n=0}^\\infty \\frac{x^n}{n!},\\; R=\\infty \\)","b_ar":"\\( e^x = \\sum_{n=0}^\\infty \\frac{x^n}{n!},\\; R=\\infty \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-series:Formula:43","ch":"ch-series","chEn":"Sequences & Series","chAr":"المتتابعات والمتسلسلات اللانهائية","tag":"Formula","f":"Sine","f_ar":"Sine (المتتابعات والمتسلسلات اللانهائية)","b":"\\( \\sin x = \\sum_{n=0}^\\infty \\frac{(-1)^n x^{2n+1}}{(2n+1)!},\\; R=\\infty \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\sin x = \\sum_{n=0}^\\infty \\frac{(-1)^n x^{2n+1}}{(2n+1)!},\\; R=\\infty \\)"},{"id":"calculus:ch-series:Formula:44","ch":"ch-series","chEn":"Sequences & Series","chAr":"المتتابعات والمتسلسلات اللانهائية","tag":"Formula","f":"Cosine","f_ar":"Cosine (المتتابعات والمتسلسلات اللانهائية)","b":"\\( \\cos x = \\sum_{n=0}^\\infty \\frac{(-1)^n x^{2n}}{(2n)!},\\; R=\\infty \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\cos x = \\sum_{n=0}^\\infty \\frac{(-1)^n x^{2n}}{(2n)!},\\; R=\\infty \\)"}]